      <h1 class="jr-h1">Collagen and Thyroid Medication: Can You Take Both?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">If you take levothyroxine and you are thinking about a collagen supplement, every answer online is either a flat "it is fine" or a vague four-hour rule, and none of them show their working. This article separates what has actually been tested from what has been borrowed from the calcium evidence, and tells you which ingredient on the label is the one that matters.</p>

