      <h2 id="ingredients">Which ingredients actually affect levothyroxine?</h2>
      <p>The collagen is not the part to check. What decides whether your supplement needs a four-hour gap or a thirty-minute one is the mineral and vitamin panel printed beside it. Here is what the evidence says about each ingredient a collagen product might carry, and where our own two products sit.</p>

